0318200149","caption":"Тедди Цуйоми (Умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TsuyomummySprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f2/TsuyomummySprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220909015533","caption":"Г-жа Цуйомумми (Умная)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MissTsuyomiIncrediblesSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e0/MissTsuyomiIncrediblesSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20230211045530","caption":"Г-жа Цуйоми (Умная)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/06/0644b9134e391f8c4ee8.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiDotsSmartKeychain.PNG","caption":"Tamagotchi Брелок в виде точек"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/69/6961c59139ce2e29f457.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiDotsSmartRubber.PNG","caption":"Tamagotchi Каучуковый ремешок в горошек"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/ad/ad8a5b7b1e547bffc5cf.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MyTamagotchiForeverSmart.PNG","caption":"Появление в My Tamagotchi Forever (только версия для Японии)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tsuyopitchi_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/66/Tsuyopitchi_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20240419194740","caption":"Tsuyopitchi sprite.png","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tuyopitchi_MametchiMemories_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/68/Tuyopitchi_MametchiMemories_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20261027161925","caption":"Tuyopitchi MametchiMemories sprite.png","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:BadtzMaruTsuyomi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c9/BadtzMaruTsuyomi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220513174624","caption":"BadtzMaruTsuyomi.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c9/BadtzMaruTsuyomi.png/revision/latest?cb=20220513174624"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GomamiSanArtwork.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bb/GomamiSanArtwork.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221028050241","caption":"GomamiSanArtwork.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bb/GomamiSanArtwork.png/revision/latest?cb=20221028050241"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:SanjiTsuyomi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8d/SanjiTsuyomi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220615184041","caption":"SanjiTsuyomi.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8d/SanjiTsuyomi.png/revision/latest?cb=20220615184041"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TeddyTsuyomiArtwork.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c6/TeddyTsuyomiArtwork.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220811051937","caption":"TeddyTsuyomiArtwork.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c6/TeddyTsuyomiArtwork.png/revision/latest?cb=20220811051937"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tsuyomummy.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bc/Tsuyomummy.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221029045302","caption":"Tsuyomummy.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bc/Tsuyomummy.png/revision/latest?cb=20221029045302"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MissTsuyomiPixarFriends.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c9/MissTsuyomiPixarFriends.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221124054138","caption":"MissTsuyomiPixarFriends.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c9/MissTsuyomiPixarFriends.png/revision/latest?cb=20221124054138"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tsuyopitchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0d/Tsuyopitchi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210619175639","caption":"Tsuyopitchi.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0d/Tsuyopitchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20210619175639"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-nano-colorful-mametchi-memories-c351a3","title":"Tamagotchi Nano Colorful: Mametchi Memories","ru":"Tamagotchi Nano Colorful: Mametchi Memories","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-pix-174e73","title":"Tamagotchi Pix","ru":"Tamagotchi Pix","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-smart-ed1a78","title":"Tamagotchi Smart","ru":"Tamagotchi Smart","kind":"device","note":""}]}